Z||000003||Carrolles||04-16-2001||04:30 PM||||When you lift the e-brake handle to engage the e-brake do you hear the click - click- click as the ratcheting mechanism engages?  If not then the ratchet pawl is probable stuck or the spring is broken.<P>Remove the e-brake handle boot (you will probable have to remove the trim piece that runs along the bottom of the door opening first) and look at the handle as you raise it to see if everything is there.<P>Just out of curousity, you are not holding the button down while you lower the handle are you?  You would depress the button only to release the brake.||||reg||1
